  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PPP Multiphase Road Infrastructure Program to Enhance Competitiveness-II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Multifase de Infraestructura Vial del PPP para la Competitividad-II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es mejorar de manera sostenible el transporte terrestre de cargas y pasajeros en los corredores prioritarios de la red vial panamea, a fin de aumentar la competitividad del pas. Adems, se busca promover la sostenibilidad del sistema vial mediante la implantacin de mecanismos permanentes de mantenimiento, y consolidar el proceso de modernizacin del MOP. En adicin, se incluir el primer componente importante de Caminos Rurales manejado por el MOP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the program is to sustainably improve land transport freight and passengers in the priority corridors of the Panamanian road network in order to increase competitiveness. In addition, it seeks to promote the sustainability of the road system through the implementation of permanent arrangements for maintenance, and consolidate the process of modernizing the MOP. In addition, include the first major component of rural roads managed by the MOP.</narrative>
  </description>
